### ============================================
### MENU SERVICE ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@path = /api/v1/menu-items

### Create a new menu item
### Request Body: ModifierDto
### Response: Created ModifierDto
POST {{baseUrl}}{{path}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 2,
  "name": "Grilled Chicken Sandwich",
  "description": "Served with fries",
  "price": 9.99,
  "isAvailable": true
}

### Get menu item by ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: ModifierDto
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get all menu items in a category
### Request Body: -
### Response: List<ModifierDto>
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/category/{categoryId}
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Update menu item by ID
### Request Body: ModifierDto
### Response: Updated ModifierDto
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Delete menu item by ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: No content (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json